---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Value Flow - Sthenos">
  <nav>
    <a href="/">Sthenos</a>
    <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
    <a href="/drill">Drill</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="section" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?w=1920&q=80');">
    <div class="content">
      <p class="label">02_value_flow.html</p>
      <h1>Value Flow</h1>
      <p>How raw data transforms into strategic advantage. Value propagates through five stages. Each transformation increases confidence and reduces uncertainty for decision-makers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="value-stages">
      <div class="stage">
        <span class="stage-num">01</span>
        <div class="stage-content">
          <h3>Raw Trajectories</h3>
          <p>Movement traces + geometry from Caldera. Low confidence, high uncertainty.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stage-arrow">→</div>
      <div class="stage">
        <span class="stage-num">02</span>
        <div class="stage-content">
          <h3>Structured Signals</h3>
          <p>Normalized features + spatial context. Confidence rising.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stage-arrow">→</div>
      <div class="stage">
        <span class="stage-num">03</span>
        <div class="stage-content">
          <h3>Behavioral Patterns</h3>
          <p>Interaction graphs + temporal features. Pattern recognition.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stage-arrow">→</div>
      <div class="stage">
        <span class="stage-num">04</span>
        <div class="stage-content">
          <h3>Role Attribution</h3>
          <p>Entity classification + decision traces. High confidence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stage-arrow">→</div>
      <div class="stage highlight">
        <span class="stage-num">05</span>
        <div class="stage-content">
          <h3>Strategic Insight</h3>
          <p>WISDOM-aligned output for decision support. Highest confidence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid" style="margin-top: 64px;">
      <div>
        <h3>Confidence Growth</h3>
        <p>Uncertainty decreases as data flows through pipeline. Raw data: low confidence. Strategic insight: high confidence.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Latency Budget</h3>
        <p>Ingestion is variable; enrichment and pattern detection are bounded. Signal generation is deterministic.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Value Accumulation</h3>
        <p>Each transformation stage adds context. Raw GPS → enriched features → interaction graphs → role labels.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    padding: 24px 5%;
    z-index: 100;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 0%, transparent 100%);
  }

  nav a {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.17px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .content-section {
    background: var(--space-black);
    padding: 80px 5%;
  }

  .value-stages {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .stage {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
    background: var(--ghost-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--ghost-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    min-width: 200px;
  }

  .stage.highlight {
    border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5);
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
  }

  .stage-num {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  p {
    font-size: 13px;
    opacity: 0.7;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .stage-arrow {
    font-size: 24px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 48px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .value-stages { flex-direction: column; }
    .stage-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  }
</style>